      "text": "I sat by the window, watching the rain lashing against the glass. The news of von der Leyen’s comments and New Delhi’s protests were swirling in my mind like storm clouds over Europe. Suddenly, a report about power plant attacks reached me – another reminder that this place could be next. I shivered, feeling the weight of these unpredictable storms bearing down on all of us.",
